# remotion/데모 영상 렌더 산출물 — 수 GB라 업로드 시 1GB 파일 한도 초과(배포 실패). 앱과 무관.
out
remotion/out
scripts/_gen_audit_out
# 로그인/진단 프로브 스크립트 — 자격증명 포함 가능, 배포 컨텍스트에 올리지 않는다.
scripts/_probe-*
/*.pdf
*.log

# scratch / local-only working files (do NOT ship to production)
.tmp
# scratch diagnostics / benchmarks — may contain API keys, never ship
scripts/_diag-*
scripts/_dump-*
scripts/_step-*
scripts/bench-*
_diag-*

# sensitive: call recordings + transcripts must not be publicly served
public/*.m4a
public/*.mp3
public/*.wav
public/*.transcript.txt
public/*.transcript.meta.txt

# untracked PDFs in public root (copyrighted/source materials, not app assets)
public/*.pdf

# office/source documents in public must never be publicly served
# (backup layer — sensitive files are also kept OUT of public/ entirely)
public/*.docx
public/*.doc
public/*.xlsx
public/*.xls
public/*.pptx
public/*.hwp
public/*.hwpx
/*.docx

# unrelated marketing/scratch images (bloat, not referenced by app)
public/brixs-strawberry-latte-*
